  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nProduct of two numbers = 2025\n\nHCF = 15\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nProduct of two numbers = HCF × LCM\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 2025 = 15 × LCM\n\n⇒ LCM = 2025 ÷ 15\n\n⇒ LCM = 135\n\n**∴ The LCM of the two numbers = 135.**",
